// Chinese presentation copy. Original records and source text stay intact.
export const translations = {
  "Bamboo shadows sweep the stairs, yet the dust moves not; the moon pierces the pond, yet the water bears no scar.": "竹影扫阶尘不动，月穿潭底水无痕。",
  "Ten thousand branches hang down like green silk ribbons.": "万条垂下绿丝绦。",
  "The moonlight is like clear water; the algae and water grasses cross each other, perhaps the shadows of bamboo and cypress.": "庭下如积水空明，水中藻荇交横，盖竹柏影也。",
  "Leisurely tapping chess pieces, watching the wick flowers fall.": "闲敲棋子落灯花。",
  "Outside the city of Gusu, from the Cold Mountain Temple, the midnight bell reaches the traveler's boat.": "姑苏城外寒山寺，夜半钟声到客船。",
  "Listening to the rain in a lonely boat, every drop falls upon the heart.": "孤舟听雨，每一滴都落在心上。",
  "Walking to where the water ends, sitting to watch the clouds rise.": "行到水穷处，坐看云起时。",
  "A fleeting face, a quiet thought. Some moments stay long after they have passed.": "一张偶然望见的脸，一个静下来的念头。有些片刻过去很久，仍会想起。",
  "I heard a fly buzz when I died; The stillness round my form Was like the stillness in the air Between the heaves of storm.": "临终时，我听见一只苍蝇嗡鸣。四周的寂静，像风暴间歇时凝住的空气。",
  "Our share of night to bear, Our share of morning, Our blank in bliss to fill, Our blank in scorning.": "我们各有一份黑夜要承受，各有一份清晨要迎接；各有一份空白留给幸福，也有一份留给轻蔑。",
  "'T is so much joy! 'T is so much joy! If I should fail, what poverty! And yet, as poor as I Have ventured all upon a throw;": "多么欢喜，多么欢喜！若我失去，会是何等贫穷。可即使如此贫穷，我也曾把所有押在这一掷。",
  "Glee! The great storm is over! Four have recovered the land; Forty gone down together Into the boiling sand.": "欢呼吧，大风暴已经过去！四个人回到了岸上；四十个人一同沉下，没入翻涌的沙浪。",
  "Some things that fly there be, -- Birds, hours, the bumble-bee: Of these no elegy. Some things that stay there be, --": "世上有些东西会飞去，鸟儿、时光与大黄蜂，无须为它们写挽歌。也有些东西会留下。",
  "When night is almost done, And sunrise grows so near That we can touch the spaces, It 's time to smooth the hair": "夜快尽了，日出已近，仿佛伸手便能触到那一片空隙。该把头发轻轻理好了。",
  "Read, sweet, how others strove, Till we are stouter; What they renounced, Till we are less afraid;": "亲爱的，读读别人怎样努力，直到我们也变得坚强；读读他们曾放下什么，直到我们不再害怕。",
  "Pain has an element of blank; It cannot recollect When it began, or if there were A day when it was not.": "疼痛中有一种空白。它记不起从何时开始，也想不起是否曾有一天，自己并不存在。",
  "I taste a liquor never brewed, From tankards scooped in pearl; Not all the vats upon the Rhine Yield such an alcohol!": "我尝过从未酿造的酒，盛在珍珠雕成的杯中；莱茵河畔所有的酒桶，也酿不出这样的醇香。",
  "'T was such a little, little boat That toddled down the bay! 'T was such a gallant, gallant sea That beckoned it away!": "那是一只小小的船，摇摇晃晃穿过海湾。那是一片勇敢的海，招手把它唤向远方。",
  "Whether my bark went down at sea, Whether she met with gales, Whether to isles enchanted She bent her docile sails;": "我的小舟是否沉入海中，是否遇见狂风，是否扬起驯顺的帆，驶向了迷人的岛屿。",
  "The brain within its groove Runs evenly and true; But let a splinter swerve, 'T were easier for you": "思绪沿着自己的轨道，平稳而准确地行进。可只要一枚细刺使它偏离，一切便不再那么容易。",
  "Mine by the right of the white election! Mine by the royal seal! Mine by the sign in the scarlet prison Bars cannot conceal!": "凭那纯白的选择，我拥有了你；凭那庄严的印记，凭藏在猩红牢笼里的暗号，连铁栏也遮不住。",
  "You left me, sweet, two legacies, -- A legacy of love A Heavenly Father would content, Had He the offer of;": "亲爱的，你留给我两份遗赠。其中一份是爱，若能得到，即使天父也会心满意足。",
  "Alter? When the hills do. Falter? When the sun Question if his glory Be the perfect one.": "改变吗？等群山改变的时候吧。动摇吗？等太阳开始怀疑，自己的光辉是否足够完整。",
  "Doubt me, my dim companion! Why, God would be content With but a fraction of the love Poured thee without a stint.": "怀疑我吗，我朦胧的同伴？你毫不保留倾注的爱，哪怕只分得一点，上帝也会心满意足。",
  "If you were coming in the fall, I'd brush the summer by With half a smile and half a spurn, As housewives do a fly.": "若你在秋天到来，我会把夏日轻轻拂开，半带微笑，半带不耐，像人们拂去一只苍蝇。",
  "I hide myself within my flower, That wearing on your breast, You, unsuspecting, wear me too -- And angels know the rest.": "我把自己藏进花里。你将它佩在胸前，也不知不觉地带上了我，余下的事，天使会知道。",
  "Have you got a brook in your little heart, Where bashful flowers blow, And blushing birds go down to drink, And shadows tremble so?": "你小小的心里，可有一条溪流？羞怯的花在那里开放，脸红的鸟俯身饮水，连影子也轻轻颤动。",
  "As if some little Arctic flower, Upon the polar hem, Went wandering down the latitudes, Until it puzzled came": "仿佛一朵北极的小花，沿着极地的边缘，独自走过一道道纬线，走进了陌生之处。",
  "My river runs to thee: Blue sea, wilt welcome me? My river waits reply. Oh sea, look graciously!": "我的河流奔向你。蓝色的海，你可愿接纳？我的河流正等着回答，海啊，请温柔地看顾。",
  "'T was a long parting, but the time For interview had come; Before the judgment-seat of God, The last and second time": "那是一场漫长的离别。可重逢的时刻终于到了；在上帝的审判席前，这是第二次，也是最后一次。",
  "She rose to his requirement, dropped The playthings of her life To take the honorable work Of woman and of wife.": "她起身回应他的要求，放下生活中的玩物，去承担那份被称作女人与妻子的体面职责。",
  "Come slowly, Eden! Lips unused to thee, Bashful, sip thy jasmines, As the fainting bee,": "伊甸园，请慢一点来。还不习惯你的双唇，羞怯地啜饮你的茉莉，如同一只微醺的蜜蜂。",
  "Perhaps you'd like to buy a flower? But I could never sell. If you would like to borrow Until the daffodil": "也许你想买一朵花？可我舍不得卖。若你只是想借走，等水仙开的时候归还。",
  "The grass so little has to do, -- A sphere of simple green, With only butterflies to brood, And bees to entertain,": "小草没有多少事情要做，只守着一小片单纯的绿，供蝴蝶停留，招待来访的蜜蜂。",
  "A drop fell on the apple tree, Another on the roof; A half a dozen kissed the eaves, And made the gables laugh.": "一滴雨落在苹果树上，另一滴落在屋顶；又有几滴亲吻屋檐，惹得山墙也笑起来。",
  "This is the land the sunset washes, These are the banks of the Yellow Sea; Where it rose, or whither it rushes, These are the western mystery!": "这就是落日洗过的土地，这是黄海的岸边。它从哪里升起，又奔向何处，都是西方留下的谜。",
  "Like trains of cars on tracks of plush I hear the level bee: A jar across the flowers goes, Their velvet masonry": "我听见蜜蜂低低飞过，像列车行在柔软的轨道。花丛间传来轻微的震颤，穿过它们绒一般的城墙。",
  "Presentiment is that long shadow on the lawn Indicative that suns go down; The notice to the startled grass That darkness is about to pass.": "预感是草地上那道长长的影子，告诉我们太阳将落；惊醒的草叶由此得知，黑暗就要经过。",
  "As children bid the guest good-night, And then reluctant turn, My flowers raise their pretty lips, Then put their nightgowns on.": "像孩子向客人道过晚安，又依依不舍地转身。我的花儿也扬起小小的唇，然后披上了睡衣。",
  "Angels in the early morning May be seen the dews among, Stooping, plucking, smiling, flying: Do the buds to them belong?": "清早，可以在露水间看见天使。它们弯腰、采撷、微笑、飞翔；那些花苞，难道都属于它们吗？",
  "It makes no difference abroad, The seasons fit the same, The mornings blossom into noons, And split their pods of flame.": "外面的世界并没有什么不同，四季依旧合身。清晨开成正午，又绽开火焰般的果荚。",
  "The mountain sat upon the plain In his eternal chair, His observation omnifold, His inquest everywhere.": "群山坐在平原上，坐在它永恒的椅子里。目光越过万物，探问遍及四方。",
  "I'll tell you how the sun rose, -- A ribbon at a time. The steeples swam in amethyst, The news like squirrels ran.": "我来告诉你，太阳怎样升起：先是一缕缕丝带，尖塔浮在紫晶般的光里，消息像松鼠一样奔跑。",
  "Apparently with no surprise To any happy flower, The frost beheads it at its play In accidental power.": "霜用偶然的力量，斩下正玩耍的花朵。对于那朵快乐的花，它仿佛一点也不惊讶。",
  "These are the days when birds come back, A very few, a bird or two, To take a backward look. These are the days when skies put on": "这是鸟儿回来的日子。并不多，只一两只，回头看看旧时光；这也是天空换上新衣的日子。",
  "The sky is low, the clouds are mean, A travelling flake of snow Across a barn or through a rut Debates if it will go.": "天空低垂，云层阴沉。一片远行的雪，经过谷仓与车辙，迟疑着要往哪里去。",
  "I think the hemlock likes to stand Upon a marge of snow; It suits his own austerity, And satisfies an awe": "我想，铁杉喜欢站在积雪边。那份寂静合它的性情，也安放着一种敬畏。",
  "There's a certain slant of light, On winter afternoons, That oppresses, like the weight Of cathedral tunes.": "冬日午后，有一种斜斜的光压在心上，像教堂里庄重的乐声。",
  "Safe in their alabaster chambers, Untouched by morning and untouched by noon, Sleep the meek members of the resurrection, Rafter of satin, and roof of stone.": "在雪白的石室中安睡，清晨与正午都无法惊扰。那些温顺等待复活的人，枕着绸缎，覆着石顶。",
  "On this long storm the rainbow rose, On this late morn the sun; The clouds, like listless elephants, Horizons straggled down.": "漫长的风雨中，彩虹升起；迟来的清晨里，太阳终于露面。云朵像倦怠的象，沿地平线缓缓散去。",
  "My cocoon tightens, colors tease, I'm feeling for the air; A dim capacity for wings Degrades the dress I wear.": "我的茧渐渐收紧，颜色在外面招引，我摸索着空气。翅膀尚不熟练，却已让我厌倦这身旧衣。",
  "Exultation is the going Of an inland soul to sea, -- Past the houses, past the headlands, Into deep eternity!": "欢欣，是内陆的灵魂终于走向大海。越过房屋，越过岬角，驶入深深的永恒。",
  "Look back on time with kindly eyes, He doubtless did his best; How softly sinks his trembling sun In human nature's west!": "请用温柔的目光回望时光，它想必已尽了全力。它颤动的太阳，在人生的西边，多么轻柔地落下。",
  "A train went through a burial gate, A bird broke forth and sang, And trilled, and quivered, and shook his throat Till all the churchyard rang;": "火车驶过墓园的门，一只鸟忽然放声歌唱。它婉转、颤鸣，抖动喉咙，直到歌声响遍墓园。",
  "I died for beauty, but was scarce Adjusted in the tomb, When one who died for truth was lain In an adjoining room.": "我为美而死，刚在坟中安顿下来，隔壁便有人躺下，说自己为真理而死。",
  "Success is counted sweetest By those who ne'er succeed. To comprehend a nectar Requires sorest need.": "从未成功的人，最懂得成功的甘甜。要尝出花蜜的滋味，须有最深的渴望。"
};
